OL,3,GNEWSAResults due at national giant veg
OL,4,Acompetition as farmers describe
OL,5,Apressure after 'brutal' summer
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK's biggest vegetables are being
OL,8,Fjudged at the National Giant Vegetables
OL,9,FChampionship in Malvern - here are the
OL,10,Frules
OL,12,FFrom the heaviest aubergine to the
OL,13,Flongest runner bean, 169 growers are
OL,14,Fcompeting across 33 categories
OL,16,FWhile we wait for the results in full,
OL,17,Fit is announced that seven world
OL,18,Frecords have been provisionally set,
OL,19,Fincluding for the heaviest beetroot and
OL,20,Fsunflower head
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
