OL,3,GNEWSAResults due at national giant veg
OL,4,Acompetition as farmers describe
OL,5,Apressure after 'brutal' summer
OL,6,
OL,7,FHopeful grower Tim Saint says he tended
OL,8,Fto his giant pumpkin before and after
OL,9,Fwork everyday: "It's been very time
OL,10,Fconsuming this year with watering as we
OL,11,Fhad a hosepipe ban"
OL,13,FThis year's competition comes after the
OL,14,FUK's hottest summer on record, with
OL,15,Ffarmers telling our reporter that a
OL,16,F"brutal" few months has left them
OL,17,F"feeling the financial pressure"
OL,19,FDerek Hulme, another of this year's
OL,20,Fcontestants, says the summer's
OL,21,Fheatwaves "played havoc" with his veg
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
